('FND-055','Staying and changing require the actual product/service/route/organisational object, rather than a binary supplier label.',['RET6-C01','RET6-C03','RET6-C04','ROOT6-C03','ROOT6-C04'],'Selected public employer contexts do not establish private-market prevalence, complete contract execution or general supplier outcomes.','Record the relevant changed and retained components; keep selected/retained option separate from dated disposition, delivery and benefit.'),
