('FND-057','Approval, postponed release, scoped access and observed processing are different dated states.',['RET6-C01','RET6-C02','RET6-C03','STL6-C01','STL6-C02','ROOT6-C03','ROOT6-C04'],'Public decision labels and management announcements are not signed commitments, complete operational assurance, cash savings or causal benefit evidence.','Use the relevant event/object/as-of date. A rollout delay does not automatically change proposal disposition; source silence does not establish pending or no approval required.'),
